WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.506
Ahem! Professor Luxcraft’s Introduction to…Sprytes

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.175
for the benefit of tiny humans.

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:11.511
Greetings, humans!

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:14.472
My name is Professor Luxcraft!

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:16.266
Can you see me okay?

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:20.520
Good. Not all humans can see Sprytes you see

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.314
but clearly you are one of the special ones.

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:27.318
Now, most humans don’t even know we Sprytes exist,

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:30.447
but the truth of it is Sprytes are everywhere.

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:33.241
We Sprytes are the creators and guardians of everything 

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:36.619
you humans would call ‘the natural world.’ 

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:40.707
The Cloud Sprytes, and Mountain Sprytes, and, 

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.500
oh, look! There’s one now!

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:44.961
A Forest Spryte! 

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:47.797
You see, didn’t I tell you? 

00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:49.382
But that’s just the beginning.

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:54.179
Sprytes come in many shapes and sizes. 

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.515
There are Forest Sprytes who make trees,

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:01.102
and Dream Sprytes who make dreams, 

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:03.438
and Rabbit Sprytes, and Rain Sprytes,

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:04.856
and Rock Sprytes, and Bird Sprytes,

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:06.775
and Time Sprytes, and Ice Sprytes

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:09.569
and every Spryte has a role to play in creating things

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:11.362
for the human realm.

00:01:11.362 --> 00:01:13.239
But, of course, that is only once they’ve discovered 

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:16.576
what kind of Spryte they are destined to be.

00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:19.746
Young Sprytes must go through intensive training 

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:22.165
and learn how to hone their Spryte powers

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:24.334
before they can play their parts. 

00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:26.795
That’s all I have to tell you for now. 

00:01:27.128 --> 00:01:28.880
If you want to learn more, you’ll have to come and

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.632
visit us in the Everything Factory. 

00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:32.675
To get there you need to find a portal.

00:01:33.384 --> 00:01:35.095
But where would you find one? 

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.888
[chuckles]

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:38.306
I’ll never tell…

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:42.685
[laughter]

